<div class="wrap prose"><h1 class="ph">Best MCP servers that actually work in Cursor</h1>
<p class="lead">We put each MCP server in <code>~/.cursor/mcp.json</code> inside a throwaway sandbox (no accounts, no API keys) and counted it as working only if Cursor reported it ready and listed its tools. In our latest run{% if testing.runAt %} ({{ testing.runAt | replace("T"," ") }}){% endif %}, <b>{{ ok.length }} of {{ ok.length + bad.length }}</b> connected.</p>
{% set total = ok.length + bad.length %}
<h2>Which MCP servers actually work in Cursor?</h2>
